		"name": "drey/EventSports",
		"description": "Postman Collection for api_events_sports (Sports Events Management Backend) built with Spring Boot 3.4.3 and Java 21 adhering to Hexagonal Architecture.\n\nSeparated into Anonymous (Authentication, Health) and Protected (Authenticated with JWT Bearer token) folders.\nAuthentication tests automatically populate the `auth_token` collection variable upon successful login.",
